    "text": "Feria Tertia In Letania Maiore Se eadiga apostol Iacobus us manode on \u00feam pistole, \u00fee us man her\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0, se healica apostol, Andetta\u00f0 eowra synna eow betweonan and gebidde eower \u00e6lc for o\u00f0erne to\nNe cw\u00e6\u00f0 se apostol for\u00f0i \u00feas word \u00fee God \u00e6lmihtig ure andettednysse be\u00feurfe, for\u00f0am \u00fee him synd\nSe \u00fee hine sylfne wreg\u00f0 and his gyltas her on life begeomera\u00f0, n\u00e6f\u00f0 se deofol on domesd\u00e6g, \u00fe\u00e6r\nAc \u00feam \u00f0e his synna her nele o\u00fe\u00fee forhoga\u00f0 to andettenne, he sceal beforan heofenlican\nNis us nan \u00feing selre on \u00feysum life \u00feonne we behreowsian ure synna, and hi mid \u00e6lmessan alysan her\nNis nan mann on eor\u00f0an swa m\u00e6re ne swa mihtig \u00fe\u00e6t he ne scule dea\u00fees abyrgean, and mid ure sawle\nWa bi\u00f0 hire \u00feonne earmre gif heo ana stent ealra godra d\u00e6da bed\u00e6led on domesd\u00e6ge beforan Gode and\n\u00d0\u00e6r beo\u00f0 \u00feonne on us sylfum gesyne and opene ealle \u00fea gyltas \u00fee we \u00e6fre gefremedon o\u00fe\u00fee dydon on\nFor\u00f0an \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r he m\u00e6g nan mann o\u00feran gehelpan, ne se f\u00e6der \u00feam sunu ne se sunu \u00feam f\u00e6der, ne nan\nAc anra gehwylcum menn \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00f0 gedemed \u00e6fter his agenum gewyrhtum.\nAc uton andettan ure synna \u00fea hwile \u00fee we magon and moton; \u00feonne gebeorge we us sylfum wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t\nGod us ealle gestrangie and getrymme to ure agenre \u00feearfe, and us gehealde swa his willa sy.\nGod is ure ealra F\u00e6der, and he \u00fe\u00e6t gecydde \u00fea \u00f0a he asende his agen Bearn hider, Crist of heofenum,\nAnd he for eall mancynn dea\u00fe \u00ferowode and us ealle \u00fea \u00f0urh his dea\u00f0 alysde of \u00f0am ecan dea\u00fee and us\n\u00d0urh cl\u00e6ne m\u00e6den Crist wear\u00f0 geboren, and \u00feurh cl\u00e6ne fulluht we syndon ealle cristene gewordene.\n\u00fe\u00e6t we sceolon eac on ealre cl\u00e6nnysse healdon gif we \u00e6nige miltse begytan sculon \u00e6t Gode.\nCrist \u00f0rowode dea\u00fe for us synleas; \u00feonne moton we be gewyrhtum fela for urum synnum \u00ferowian and\nUton us habban symle gemyndige \u00feone timan \u00fee us toweard is \u00feonne se earma lichama and seo werige\nNe magon hi us \u00feonne \u00e6nigum Gode ac bi\u00f0 \u00e6t Gode anum gelang eall hw\u00e6t we gefaran sculon.\nGe\u00feence gehwa him sylf hu sceort and hu earmlic \u00feis l\u00e6ne lif is.\nAc ne \u00feence we na fram d\u00e6ge to d\u00e6ge \u00fe\u00e6t we to Gode ne gecyrran, for\u00f0an \u00fee we us nyton witodlice lif\nNe we nyton \u00feonne we to ure reste ga\u00f0 hw\u00e6\u00f0er we moton eft d\u00e6ges abidan.\nHit is sorhlic and earmlic eallum cristenum mannum to gehyrenne eall \u00fe\u00e6t man us foreseg\u00f0 embe\nUs is eallum swi\u00f0e micel \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we understandan \u00fe\u00e6t hit to \u00feam dome nu geornlice geneal\u00e6c\u00f0, \u00fee\nWe habba\u00f0 oncnawen fela \u00fe\u00e6ra foretacna \u00fee Crist sylf fores\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t her cuman sceolde on \u00feysne\nHe s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6fter \u00feisum f\u00e6ce gyt geweor\u00f0an sceall swa egeslic tima swa n\u00e6fre \u00e6r ne wear\u00f0 sy\u00f0\u00f0an\nUton don for\u00f0i, swa us micel \u00feearf is, beon geornfulle ure agenre \u00f0earfe, geswican ura synna and\nNe sceal n\u00e6fre nanum cristenum menn to langsum \u00feincan \u00fe\u00e6t he his agene \u00feearfe gehyre seggan.\nSo\u00f0lice us eallum is gem\u00e6ne neod and healic \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we georne cyricsocna began, and us \u00fe\u00e6r synna\nNe m\u00e6g ure nan him nane mare \u00f0earfe began \u00feonne he \u00feyder ga \u00fe\u00e6r he mage his Drihten him\nWe sceolan swy\u00f0e inlice on cyrcan to Gode clypian \u00fe\u00e6t he us arie and wi\u00f0 deofol bewerige and to\nHit is swi\u00f0e un\u00fe\u00e6slic and pleolic \u00fe\u00e6t we on Godes huse idele spellunga and hlacerunga began, for\u00f0i \u00fee\nTo uran for\u00f0si\u00f0e cuma\u00f0 Godes englas and ure sawla fram lichaman totw\u00e6ma\u00f0 and hi to Drihtenes\n\u00deonne beo\u00f0 ure sawla gemyndige ure \u00e6rran misd\u00e6da and swi\u00f0e forhtiga\u00f0 and bifia\u00f0 and for \u00fean\nFor\u00f0i sceal \u00e6lc mann hine sylfne georne to Gode ge\u00feeodan on \u00e6lce wisan, ge on gebedum ge on\nAnd \u00fea \u00f0e his lare filia\u00f0 and his bebodum, he forgyf\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ylce rice \u00fee he him sylf on wuna\u00f0 and him\nAnd we eac geornlice d\u00e6ghwamlice biddan \u00e6t Gode \u00fe\u00e6t he us gescylde and bewerige wi\u00f0 \u00f0one\nAnd uton for\u00f0i geornlice \u00e6fre cunnian hu we magon his leasunga and his swicdomas and his lare mid\nFor\u00f0am \u00fee him is \u00e6fre swa leofre swa he ma manna forp\u00e6re mid his lotwrencum to forwyrde, and he us\nAc uton \u00e6fre ge on gelimpe ge on ungelimpe geornlice to Gode clypian and his helpes biddan and\nNu by\u00f0 for\u00f0ig micel r\u00e6d \u00feam \u00f0e his sylfes rec\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he him gebige \u00fe\u00e6t ece lif \u00fee we ymbe spreca\u00f0.\nNu \u00fe\u00e6ngst \u00f0u and cwyst, Hu m\u00e6g ic \u00fe\u00e6t ece lif gebiggan.\nIc \u00fee segge, Syle \u00fee sylfne Gode swa \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu lufige \u00fea \u00feing \u00fee God lufa\u00f0 and \u00fea \u00feing ascunige \u00fee God\nGod bebyt \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu lufige \u00feynne nyhstan swa swa \u00fee sylfne.\nEft he cwy\u00f0, Gyf ge forgyfa\u00f0 \u00feam mannum \u00fee wi\u00f0 eow agylta\u00f0, \u00feonne forgyf\u00f0 eow eower F\u00e6der\nGyf ge \u00feonne nella\u00f0 forgyfan, nele eac eower F\u00e6der eow forgyfan eowre gyltas.\nGe gehyra\u00f0 nu, mine gebro\u00f0ra, \u00fe\u00e6t hit stent \u00feurh Godes gyfe on urum agenum dihte hu us by\u00f0 \u00e6t\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0, Gyf ge forgyfa\u00f0, eow by\u00f0 forgyfen.\nNe bep\u00e6ce nan mann hine sylfne.\nWitodlice gyf hwa fur\u00f0on \u00e6nne mann hata\u00f0 on \u00feysum middanearde, swa hw\u00e6t swa he to gode gede\u00fe,\nFor\u00f0an \u00fee se apostol Paulus ne by\u00f0 geligenod \u00fee cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00deeah \u00f0e ic aspende ealle mine \u00e6hta on\nBe \u00feam ylcan cw\u00e6\u00f0 se godspellere Iohannes, Se \u00f0e his bro\u00f0or ne lufa\u00f0, he wuna\u00f0 on dea\u00fee.\nEft he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00c6lc \u00fe\u00e6ra \u00f0e his bro\u00f0er hata\u00f0 is manslaga.\nEalle we synd gebro\u00f0ra \u00fee on God gelyfa\u00f0 and we ealle cwe\u00f0a\u00fe, Pater noster qui es in celis; \u00f0\u00e6t is, \u00deu\nNe gedyrstl\u00e6ce nan mann be m\u00e6g\u00f0hade buton so\u00f0re lufe.\nNe truwige nan mann be \u00e6lmesd\u00e6dum o\u00fe\u00fee on gebedum butan \u00fe\u00e6re fores\u00e6dan lufe; for\u00f0an \u00fee swa\nAc gyf he wille \u00fe\u00e6t him God milde sy, \u00feonne hlyste he godes r\u00e6des, na of minum mu\u00f0e ac of Cristes\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0, Gif \u00f0u offrast \u00feine lac to Godes weofode and \u00feu \u00f0\u00e6r gemyndig byst \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fein bro\u00f0er h\u00e6f\u00f0\nGyf \u00f0u \u00feinum cristenum bre\u00f0er deredest, \u00feonne h\u00e6f\u00f0 he sum \u00f0ing ongean \u00fee and \u00feu scealt be Godes\nGyf \u00feonne se cristena mann \u00fee \u00fein bro\u00f0or is \u00fee ahwar geyfelode, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu scealt miltsigende forgyfan.\nUre gastlican lac synd ure gebeda and lofsang and huselhalgung and gehwylce o\u00f0re lac \u00fee we Gode\nNu cwy\u00f0 sum mann ongean \u00fea r\u00e6dinge, Ne m\u00e6g ic minne feond lufian \u00feone \u00fee ic d\u00e6ghwamlice\nEala, \u00feu mann, \u00f0u sceawast hw\u00e6t \u00fein bro\u00f0or \u00fee dyde and \u00feu ne sceawast hw\u00e6t \u00f0u Gode gedydest\nHwi nelt \u00f0u forgyfan \u00fea lytlan gyltas anum menn \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00e6lmihtiga God \u00fee \u00fea micclan synna forgyfe?\nNu cwyst \u00feu eft, Micel gedeorf bi\u00f0 me \u00fe\u00e6t ic minne feond lufige and for \u00f0one gebidde \u00fee me hearmes\nNe wi\u00f0cwe\u00f0e we \u00fe\u00e6t hit mycel gedeorf ne sy, ac gyf hit is hefig tyme on \u00feyssere worulde, hit becym\u00f0\nWitodlice \u00feurh \u00feines feondes lufe \u00feu byst Godes freond, and na \u00fe\u00e6t an \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu his freond sy, ac eac\nSwa swa Crist sylf cw\u00e6\u00f0, Lufia\u00f0 eowre fynd, do\u00f0 \u00feam tela \u00fee eow hatia\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t ge beon eowres F\u00e6der\n\u00deeah se mann habbe fullne geleafan and \u00e6lmyssan wyrce and fela to gode gedo, eall him by\u00f0 idel swa\nSeo so\u00f0e lufu is \u00fe\u00e6t gehwa his freond lufige on Gode and his feond for Gode.\nM\u00e6nigfealde earfo\u00f0nyssa and hospas wolde gehwa ea\u00f0elice forberan wi\u00f0 \u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t he moste sumum\nForbera\u00f0 nu ge\u00feyldelice for \u00f0am ecan wur\u00f0mynte \u00fe\u00e6t ge Godes bearn getealde beon and his\nWe segga\u00f0 eow, Godes riht healda\u00f0 gyf ge willan.\nGyf we hit forsweogia\u00f0, ne by\u00f0 us geborgen.\nCristes lufu us neada\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t we symle \u00fea godan tihtan \u00fe\u00e6t hi on godnysse \u00f0urhwunian and \u00fea yfelan we\nNe beo se rihtwisa gymeleas on his anginne ne se yfela ne ortruwige \u00feurh his unrihtwisnysse.\nSe mildheorta God cw\u00e6\u00f0 be eallum synfullum mannum twa word swy\u00f0e fremfulle, Declina a malo et\nNis na genoh \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu fram yfele gebuge butan \u00feu symle be \u00feinre m\u00e6\u00f0e god gefremme.\nGod cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he nolde \u00fe\u00e6s synfullan dea\u00f0 ac he wyle swy\u00f0or \u00fe\u00e6t he gecyrre fram his synnum and\nWe sculon beon \u00feeonde symle on godnysse and \u00e6lce d\u00e6g geeacnian us \u00fea ecan speda \u00fea hwile \u00f0e we\nNe sceal se wisa mann beon butan godum weorcum.\nne se ealda ne beo butan eawf\u00e6stnysse.\nne se iunga ne beo butan gehyrsumnysse.\nne se weliga ne beo butan \u00e6lmesd\u00e6dum.\nAc uton symle smeagan hu we magon Gode gecweman on eallum \u00feingum \u00fea hwile \u00f0e we gesundfulle\nDrihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 on sumere stowe, Arwur\u00f0a \u00feinne f\u00e6der and eac \u00feine modor and se \u00f0e f\u00e6der o\u00fe\u00fee\nSwa swa we be sumum cilde r\u00e6da\u00fe \u00fee w\u00e6s receleaslice afedd.\nHit wolde wyrian w\u00e6lhreowlice Drihten and se f\u00e6der ne rohte his receleasnysse.\n\u00dea \u00e6t nyxtan comon cwealmb\u00e6re deofla swutelice gesewene on sweartum hiwe inn to \u00feam cilde and\nHit is ger\u00e6dd \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea beo\u00f0 ges\u00e6lige \u00fee so\u00f0f\u00e6stnysse lufia\u00f0 and buton hiwunge fara\u00f0.\nFor\u00f0am wite gehwa \u00fe\u00e6t God gesyh\u00fe on \u00e6lcum menn hw\u00e6\u00f0er he f\u00e6r\u00f0 \u00fee mid so\u00f0f\u00e6stnysse \u00fee mid\n\u00c6fre he by\u00f0 andweard \u00fe\u00e6r man inlice clypa\u00f0 to him.\nBe \u00feam is awriten, Eadig by\u00f0 se mann \u00fee symle by\u00f0 forhtigende and to Gode clypiende and so\u00f0lice se\nUton nu ge\u00feencan \u00feis sceorte lif and georne clypian to \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan Gode \u00fe\u00e6t he us geunne \u00fe\u00e6s\nFor\u00f0am \u00fee nan mann nat \u00feyssere worulde geendunge ne fur\u00f0on his agene geendunge.\nM\u00e6nig mann wolde \u00feone maran d\u00e6l his lifes aspendan on his lustum and \u00feone l\u00e6ssan on d\u00e6dbote, gyf\nUs is bediglod ure geendung to \u00fey \u00fe\u00e6t we sculon symle us ondr\u00e6dan \u00feone endenyhstan d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6ne we\nWe sculon for\u00f0ig wacian on ure heortan and on geleafan; we sculon wacian on hihte and on so\u00f0re\nWe sculon wacian on godum weorcum and don buton idelum gylpe, gyf we hw\u00e6t lyttles to gode\nse \u00fee on ecnysse rixa\u00f0 on ealra worulda woruld, a butan ende. Amen.",
